{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Go, ascend from here.</b> The land of Israel is higher than all lands — therefore עֲלֵה is said. Another interpretation: just as He said to him at the time of anger ״לֶךְ רֵד,״ so He said to him at the time of favor ״לֵךְ עֲלֵה״ (Tanchuma)." "<b>You and the people.</b> Here it is not said וְעַמְּךָ."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:56:16.963235833Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}